# Project Context

- Nav Station is a Vue 3 SPA plus FastAPI API with JWT multi-user authentication and SQLite persistence.
- Before changing code, read `AGENTS.md` and the relevant document under `docs/architecture/`.
- Preserve the frontend/backend boundary: frontend components consume composables; backend owns persistent business data.
- Do not edit the plan file as part of implementation.
